{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ZVQT26xNHu1793258465.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>特首李家超強調，政治任命團隊要承擔政治責任，考慮到官員在事件的角色、未來是否要處理大量工作等，決定接受房屋局局長何永賢請辭。</p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超說：「考慮到大火發生在宏福苑，是房屋局轄下房屋署獨立審查組的負責管轄範圍，雖然火災不涉及房屋局局長個人犯錯，房屋局局長應承擔政治責任。昨日我就事件與何永賢局長會面，她向我提出請辭，表示願意承擔政治責任，我接受她的請辭，今日起停止何永賢局長的職務，由黃偉綸副司長兼任署理房屋局局長。」</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203487-%E4%BD%95%E6%B0%B8%E8%B3%A2%E5%8A%A0%E5%85%A5%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C30%E5%A4%9A%E5%B9%B4%E6%8E%8C%E7%AE%A1%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E5%B1%80%E6%9C%9F%E9%96%93%E6%8E%A8%E5%87%BA%E7%B0%A1%E7%B4%84%E5%85%AC%E5%B1%8B%E4%B8%A6%E8%90%BD%E5%AF%A6%E7%B0%A1%E6%A8%B8%E6%88%BF%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">何永賢加入政府30多年　掌管房屋局期間推出簡約公屋並落實簡樸房制度</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:21:53.757418+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":245,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:38:16.151195+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:18:23.781007+00:00","content_hash":"42f831ba45024e2e6f8ff02c1e089dc6f232ac55b310d8675ac9e463eed8827d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:21:53.757418+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}